    {
      "id": "s_rich_text",
      "type": "rich-text",
      "preset": "Default",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Working from Gothenburg",
        "body": "<p>I began photographing the harbour before I had a studio there. Walking the same route made small changes visible: a window covered, a boat moved, the water reaching another step.</p><p>The personal work grows that way. Commissions begin with a conversation about the place, the people who use it and what the photographs need to do.</p>",
        "width": "reading",
        "color_scheme": "surface-alt"
      },
      "blocks": []
    },
